 Groomed (2026-04-23)\\n\\n### Impact\\n\\nP2 Bug. Minimal scope \u2014 1\u20132 files affected. Zero runtime risk. Resolves documentation/spec confusion for future agents working on fastmcp-creator. Decision gates all work.\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- **Option A (Create)**: `plugins/fastmcp-creator/skills/fastmcp-creator/references/accessing_online_resources.md` created with content documenting how to access FastMCP online resources/docs from within MCP tools; file linked from SKILL.md\\n- **Option B (Remove)**: Locate the SAM task spec that lists this file in its preserve list; remove the phantom entry; no agent spec references a non-existent file in this plugin\\n- Exactly one option implemented \u2014 decision recorded in item resolution comment\\n\\n### Files\\n\\n- `plugins/fastmcp-creator/skills/fastmcp-creator/references/accessing_online_resources.md` \u2014 file to create (Option A) or confirm absent (Option B)\\n- `plugins/fastmcp-creator/skills/fastmcp-creator/SKILL.md` \u2014 update to link new file (Option A only)\\n- SAM task spec for fastmcp-creator v3 overhaul \u2014 remove phantom preserve entry (Option B)\\n\\n### Story\\n\\nAs a developer working on the fastmcp-creator plugin, I need the phantom reference to `accessing_online_resources.md` resolved so that task specs don't point to files that have never existed and won't confuse future agents.\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **fastmcp-creator: resolve missing accessing_online_resources.md reference file** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Artifact Manifest\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n<!-- artifact-manifest:begin -->\\n| Type | Path | Status | Agent | Created |\\n|------|------|--------|-------|-